## Why This Is Asked
This question tests data governance and cloud IAM proficiency in regulated fintech environments, focusing on data lake isolation and rapid IR.

## Key Concepts
- ABAC with tenant attributes
- Deny-by-default bucket policies
- Data-centric protection (field-level encryption/tokenization)
- Policy drift detection (IAM Access Analyzer, CloudTrail)
- Incident response for data leakage (IR playbook, forensics)

## Code Example
